#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:27
msgid ""
"`PyGeoFetch(config_path=\"my.yaml\")` loads the file into `client.config`, a"
" plain dictionary. Nothing in the engine currently reads it."
msgstr ""
"`PyGeoFetch(config_path=\"my.yaml\")` 会将该文件加载到 "
"`client.config`（一个普通字典）中。目前引擎中没有任何部分读取它。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:30
msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "凭据"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:32
msgid ""
"Credentials are **not** read from environment variables. Pass them "
"explicitly with `add_credentials()` or `pygeofetch auth add`. See "
"[Authentication](../data-access/authentication.md) and "
"[Security](security.md)."
msgstr ""
"凭据**不会**从环境变量中读取。请使用 `add_credentials()` 或 `pygeofetch auth add` "
"显式传递。参见[身份验证](../data-access/authentication.md)和[安全](security.md)。"

